              "data": "DISCHARGE SUMMARY: Patient Rajesh Kumar (ABHA 91-8844-2211-7700 / UHID-99214432), 43Y Male. Admitted under General Surgery on 10-Oct-2026 with severe right iliac fossa pain. Evaluated and diagnosed with Acute appendicitis (K35.80). Successfully underwent CPT-44970 laparoscopic appendectomy on 10-Oct-2026. Uneventful postoperative course in room accommodation. Discharged hemodynamically stable on 12-Oct-2026."
